// stringBuilder paths carry no terminator: readFile must copy [0, length)
// into a fresh NUL-terminated buffer instead of walking raw payload memory
// (pre-fix: fread opened a garbage path read past the buffer)
// exit: 0
// out: hello data
var sb = @ctor.StringBuilder();
@string.append(sb, "./data.txt");
var c = @sys.readFile(sb);
print @string.intern(c);
